%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: collegequest4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, now we have the opportunity to get a closer look at... this thing.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487803
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: The Arch-Mage needs to be informed of this immediately!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487806
    - rid: 4351268055900487807
    - rid: 4351268055900487832
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f2b4d7673734a1a43a263468a2605a5c, type: 2}
    dialog: I don't dare leave this unattended- could you two return to the college
      and inform Savos Aren of this discovery?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, whatever. Hmph!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487808
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487809
    - rid: 4351268055900487810
    - rid: 4351268055900487833
    - rid: 4351268055900487834
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh! It's one of those word walls!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487811
    - rid: 4351268055900487812
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Ah, right, let me get out my journal, then.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487813
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wait, you have a journal, Yuri?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487814
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course, I got one from Mr. gro-Shub at the library while you were
      napping.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487815
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: He said that every new student gets a free one to help with their studies.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487816
    - rid: 4351268055900487817
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Wow! Our actual high school doesn't even get us our own supplies, and
      this magical college gives us journals for free!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487818
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: I suppose this fictional world leans into more fantasies than just magical...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487819
    - rid: 4351268055900487821
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: Yuri dedicates a page of her journal to the word wall's contents.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487822
    - rid: 4351268055900487824
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 639d4037fbc3acd41947392e6542aac6, type: 2}
    dialog: As she does so, Sayori loots the nearby chest. Adding 112 septims to
      their total.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487825
    - rid: 4351268055900487826
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487836
    - rid: 4351268055900487837
    - rid: 4351268055900487838
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh. We're back at the entrance.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487839
    - rid: 4351268055900487840
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: Why do you think this place was built to loop around like that?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487841
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, I don't know.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487842
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 294377bcfa9c68d468fbdb53f597dc39, type: 2}
    dialog: '{mc} probably knows, so you should just ask him.'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487843
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd43d09d02697ee489059e7390a0597d, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess you're right.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487844
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
